{"version":1,"content":"<p>9月舉行的國際體能賽HYROX北京站中，澳洲選手Joanna Wietrzyk在比賽途中失禁仍堅持比賽並奪冠，其排泄物污染賽場器械引發公共衛生爭議。</p><p>Joanna周三（28 日）透過Instagram發片，再次就北京賽場風波致歉，同時宣布將出戰當地時間周五（30日）舉行的HYROX德國漢堡站賽事。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:21:48.522843+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.391553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:10.598697+00:00","content_hash":"ccb2903e41fe5571bf34f06d77dfa001d61e32f22f60fce77a69cd13e7b1e4bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}